<title>BRAZIL: Brazil markets closed Friday for mayoral voting.</title>
<headline>Brazil markets closed Friday for mayoral voting.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian financial markets will be closed on Friday for the second round of nationwide mayoral elections.</p>
<p>Markets are scheduled to reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
</text>
